<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id">- Oyda New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">Galaatiya</para>
  <para style="toc1">Phawuloosa Galaatiya Asuntsis Xaafide Kiita</para>
  <para style="toc2">Galaatiya</para>
  <para style="toc3">Gala.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Phawuloosa Galaatiya Asuntsis</para>
  <para style="mt2">Xaafide Kiita</para>
  <para style="imt1">Gele</para>
  <para style="ip">Yesuusa ashshiza maaqqidanno ohize Wonggele qaala dumma dumma bessa sabbakinttin, Ayhude maaqqoosse asuntsi ammanii ammanii hyanggize wode «Kiristtoosa ammanzuntsi Muse higge folodes koshshanene koshshosa?» yagaaze ooce fettilla denddida. Ye wode Phawuloosa, «Kiristtoosa ammanzuntsi Muse higge folodes koshshoos; Yesuusa gidda kille de7o demmades koshshize waanna ammano. Asuntsi Xoozze tiino xillodes dandda7ize ammano xalaalara» yaga7i tamaarssida. Yezin Eerats Isiya gidda, Galaatiya awurajja yeze woosa keetsite yeze asunts gidda, «Asi Xoozze tiino xillodes Yesuusa ammano xalaala maaqqikaayzin Muse higgen folodes koshshane» yaga7i Phawuloosa timirttito wobbize asuntsi yene.</para>
  <para style="ip">Phawuloosa Galaatiya maxaafe xaafidanna, yinna bala timirttite cimminttide asuntsana turii ammanogon ammano yessago mahodes. Phawuloosa Yesuusa hawaare maaqqizanno geeshi ohe aykkida. Eza hawaare mahi xeegide asi maaqqikaayzin Xoozii maaqqidannon E kiitinittidanna Ayhude maaqqoosse asuntsis maaqqizanno qonccizi ohida. Yinnilla aytsii asi xillodes dandda7ize ammano xalaalara maaqqizanno ohine. Wurssutsi zofantte ammano de7o Yesuusa ammanera benttize siiqoppa goggizanno maaqqidanno ohine.</para>
  <para style="iot">Aafe Qofuntsi</para>
  <para style="io1">Gele qofa <char style="ior"><ref loc="GAL 1:1-10">1:1-10</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Phawuloosa hawaaretitsi adetits wolqqa <char style="ior"><ref loc="GAL 1:11-2:21">1:11—2:21</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Xoozze aadho keehatitsi Wonggele <char style="ior"><ref loc="GAL 3:1-4:31">3:1—4:31</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Wallotitsin ammanora yessi <char style="ior"><ref loc="GAL 5:1-6:10">5:1—6:10</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Xaatsi qofa <char style="ior"><ref loc="GAL 6:11-18">6:11-18</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1"/>Asappa woy as baggara maaqqikaayzin Yesuus Kiristtoosappan eza hyayqoppa dentside Xoozze Adeppa hawaare maaqqade gaar kiitinttide ta Phawuloosa, <verse eid="GAL 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:2"/>taara yeze ammanze ishuntsi ubba, Galaatiya yeze woosa keetsuntsis.<verse eid="GAL 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3"/>Xoozze nu Adayin nu Laatstse Yesuus Kiristtoosappa yinttis aadho keehatitsin sarotitsi maaqqe.<verse eid="GAL 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4"/>Hyanna iita woditippa nuna ashshodes, nu Laatstsen, nu Aday qofa fana Kiristtoosa nu nagartti gisho fana aatsii inggida. <verse eid="GAL 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5"/>Xoozis Medhinappa medhina yellodes bonchcho maaqqe. Amin77e.<verse eid="GAL 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Turii Wonggele fetto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6"/>Kiristtoosa aadho keehatitsite yinttana xeegide Xoozza ashshii, melle Wonggelego, yin ellisii, wayzi maaqqezako tana gaama qofizane. <verse eid="GAL 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7"/>E fa ommite melle Wonggele baaya. Yinttana balitsodesin Kiristtoosa Wonggele wobbisades koyze eeratsi asuntsi yene fattin turii Wonggele fetto. <verse eid="GAL 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8"/>Yezin nuna maaqqin woy salo kiitanchcho maaqqin nu yinttis tiino ohide Wonggeleppa dummudhize Wonggele yinttis ohize baz maaqqiko, E baadinttidaya maaqqe. <verse eid="GAL 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9"/>Hyannippa zaga nu gaydannigaara hyatten mahi gaane; yin ekkide Wonggeleppa dummudhize Wonggele ooden yinttis ohiko ye atstse baaddinttida maaqqe.<verse eid="GAL 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10"/>Yeezin, tana asi woy Xoozii nashshode fana koyanene? Woy ta asi ufayssodes koyane? Ta asi ufayssodes koyze baz maaqqiko, Kiristtoosa aro maaqqoos.<verse eid="GAL 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa xeegintte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11"/>Ta ishuntso, ta yinttis ohize Wonggeltta asappa maaqqoosanno yin erode fana ta koyane. <verse eid="GAL 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12"/>Taas hyay Wonggeliza Yesuus Kiristtoosa qonccizida fattin asappa ekkikaaya woy asi tana tamaarssikaaya.<verse eid="GAL 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13"/>Ta zaga Ayhude ammano yeze wode wayzi yezezako, taanii ammanzuntsana yiqsimo baytsi bay7adesin dhabssodes butunttidanno yin si7ida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:3">Hawa. 8:3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:4-5">22:4-5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:9-11">26:9-11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14"/>Ayhude ammano naagora, ta wode yeze Ayhude ishunsappa aadhane. Nu adunts wogitisin aadhii yiqsinttane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 22:3">Hawa. 22:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="GAL 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15"/>Yezin ta hyaga ta inttii sazite yezin Xoozii tana doorida; fa aadho keehatitsite tana xeegida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15-16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:3-6">Hawa. 9:3-6</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:6-10">22:6-10</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:13-18">26:13-18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:16"/>Ayhude maaqqoosse asuntsis Wonggele ohode gaar Xoozii fa Na7aya taas qonccizide wode ta ooderan zorinttikaaya. <verse eid="GAL 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17"/>Woy taappa tiino hawaare maaqqiduntsara yellinttodes Yerusalaame hyanggikaaya. Yezin ta tiinidhii Arabe gade qitida; yinnippa maaqqii Damasqqo katama yi7ida. <verse eid="GAL 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18"/>Hyaydzdzii bereppa suuba, Phexiroosara yellinttodes Yerusalaame hyanggi eera taphpho ichchin qamma gam77ida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:26-30">Hawa. 9:26-30</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19"/>Yezin Laatstse ishe Yayqooba fattin hyankko hawaaruntsappa oonan ta bi7ikaaya.<verse eid="GAL 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20"/>Ta yinttis xaafidanna worddo maaqqoosanno Xoozze tiino yinttis markkidhane.<verse eid="GAL 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21"/>Yinnippa suuba, taanii Sooriyan Kilqiya gade qitida. <verse eid="GAL 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22"/>Yihuda yeze woosa keetsi asuntsi tana bi7i erikaaya. <verse eid="GAL 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23"/>Yezin un, «Zaga nuna bay7ize atstse, hyatte yinna E dhabssodes koyze ammantto sabbakane» yagaazanno si7ida. <verse eid="GAL 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24"/>Si7iduntsi ubba ta gisho Xoozza galatida.<verse eid="GAL 1:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Hawaaruntsi Phawuloosa ekkida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1"/>Taphpho oyddii bereppa suuba, mahi Barnnabaasan Tito ekkii Yerusalaame hyanggida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 11:30">Hawa. 11:30</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:2">15:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:2"/>Ta hyanggidannan Xoozii taas qonccizide ogera. Hyannippa tiino zaga ta oochchidannan hyatte ta oochchizanna cer maaqqaame fana Ayhude maaqqoosse asuntsis sabbakida. Woosa keetsi kaalitsizuntsana ga7i xeeginttizuntsana dumma shiishii ohida. <verse eid="GAL 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3"/>Melle atto yezin, taara yeze Tito Girike asi maaqqikon, garrazinttode gaar ga7i un7itsikaaya. <verse eid="GAL 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4"/>Yezin, aro nuna mahodesin Kiristtoos Yesuusa gidda yeze nu wallotitsito geeditera nu gidda aachintti gelide worddo ishuntsi yene. <verse eid="GAL 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5"/>Yezin turii Wonggele yin gidda miinggi xaphphii yessade gaar nuunii melle atto yezin, fettii saaten unttis kushe inggikaaya.<verse eid="GAL 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6"/>Yezin hyalaqa aazize asuntsi oodetitsita taas akkon baaya. Xoozii as sino bi7i firddoos. Hyantsi asuntsi ta markkidhize Wonggelella afa fettii bazin gujjikaaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:17">Mahe 10:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7"/>Yezin Phexiroosa, Ayhuduntsis Wonggele ohode fana Xoozii ees hyadara inggidannigaar taasin Ayhude maaqqoosse asuntsis Wonggele ohode hyadara inggidanno un suubappa tiirida. <verse eid="GAL 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8"/>Yikke, Phexiroosa Ayhuduntsi hawaare maaqqade fana oochchide Xoozze, tanan Ayhude maaqqoosse asuntsis hawaare maaqqade fana oochchida. <verse eid="GAL 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9"/>Mahi taas ingginttide aadho keehatitsito qoppide tuusi maaqqii benttize Yayqooba, Phexiroosan Wahannisa, nuna Ayhude maaqqoosse asuntsago, un Ayhude asuntsago qitodes tanan Barnnabaasan maaddodes mizaqi kushe inggida. <verse eid="GAL 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10"/>Un nuna mintsii hyadara gaydanna, nuunii dahuntsis qoppode fana. Tiinon ta yinno oochchodes amudhdhane.<verse eid="GAL 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Phexiroosa qoftto ixxida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11"/>Phexiroosa Anxookiya katama yi7ide wode E balide gisho taanii E tiintte eqqii «Neenii balida» gayda. <verse eid="GAL 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12"/>Yayqooba kiittide fettii fettii asunsi Anxookiya yo7odeppa tiino E Ayhude maaqqoosse ammanzuntsara mu7ine, yezin un yi7idannippa suuba, «Ayhude maaqqoosse asuntsappa ammaniduntsii garrazinttodes beezane» gaaze asuntsis zhashtii unttappa shaakkinttida. <verse eid="GAL 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13"/>Fettii fettii ammanide Ayhuduntsi Phexiroosa oochite kaallida. Melle atto yezin, Barnnabaasan yinna qofite giigida.<verse eid="GAL 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14"/>Yezin un Wonggele turira luule yedhdhosanno bi7i, Phexiroosa as ubba tiino, «Neenii Ayhude maaqqittera, Ayhude woga fana maaqqikaayzin Ayhude maaqqoosse asuntsi fana yene; yeezin, wayzi Ayhude maaqqoosuntsana, ‹Ayhude wogara yezote› ga7i wolqqidhe?» yagayda.<verse eid="GAL 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15"/>Nuunii yelinttera Ayhude, yezin nagaranchcho maaqqide Ayhude maaqqoosse asunts fana baaya. <verse eid="GAL 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16"/>Yezin asi Yesuus Kiristtoosa ammanii xillane fattin higge naagii xillossanno erane. Ooden asho ma77ide ubba higge naagii xilloosse gisho nuunin higge naagii maaqqikaayzin Kiristtoosa gidda ammanii xillodes Kiristtoos Yesuusa ammanida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 143:2">Maz. 143:2</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 3:20">Rome 3:20</ref>, <ref loc="ROM 3:22">22</ref></char></note><verse eid="GAL 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17"/>Nu Ayhuduntsin Kiristtoosa baggara xillodes koshshane. Yinno maaqqiko nuunin melle asuntsi fana nagaranchcho maaqqizanno be7ine. Yeezin, nu nagara oochchode fana dentsitsize Kiristtoosa ga7inttanene? Mulon baaya! <verse eid="GAL 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18"/>Yikke, ta wul7idanno mahi keexizebaz maaqqiko taanii ta ommite higge mentsizaya maaqqizanno markkidhane. <verse eid="GAL 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19"/>Taanii Xoozis de7o maaqqii yessade fana higge baggara higges hyayqqida. <verse eid="GAL 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20"/>Taanii Kiristtoosara masqalalla afa suxunttida. Taanii yikkeppa taas yezoos, yezin Kiristtoosa ta gidda yene. Ta hyatte ashora yeze yestto, tana kadhii ta gisho fana aatsii inggide Xoozze Na7a ammanii yene. <verse eid="GAL 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21"/>Taanii Xoozze aadho keehatitsito cer ashshoos. Xillotitsi asis higge baggara benttize baz maaqqizako, Kiristtoosa hyarii hyayqqida ga7e.<verse eid="GAL 2:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Xillotitsii ammanora</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1"/>Hyantsi, qoppoosse Galaatiya asuntso, yin aafti tiintte Kiristtoosa masqalalla suxunttide si7ile fana qonccii benttane. Yeezin, turis yin kiitinttaame fana yinttana doccizide oode?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 27:26">Mahe 27:26</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2"/>Ta fettibaz erodes koyane; yin Geeshi Ayyaana ekkidanna higge naagine woy Wonggele qaala ammanii ekkidate? <verse eid="GAL 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3"/>Yin yinnii fana qoppoosuntsana? Yin Xoozze Ayyaanara aykkii, hyatte ashora folodes koyane? <verse eid="GAL 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4"/>Yin Wonggele baggara gaama waayidanna hyarii? Yinna waayita ubba cer maaqqida? <verse eid="GAL 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5"/>Xoozii yinttis Geeshi Ayyaana inggidannan yin gidda kille baz oochchizanna, yin higge naagide gishone woy Wonggele si7i ammanide gisho?<verse eid="GAL 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6"/>Ane Abrahama bo7ote, «E Xooz ammanida; Xoozii ees yinno xillotitsi mahi faydida»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Medho 15:6</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 4:3">Rome 4:3</ref></char></note>ga7intti xaafinttida. <verse eid="GAL 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7"/>Yikke, ammanzuntsi Abrahama na7untsana maaqqizanno erote.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:16">Rome 4:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8"/>Xoozii Ayhude maaqqoosse asuntsana ammanora xillissadanno tiino Geeshi Maxaafe bi7i, «Worzha ubba neera anjjinttoda» yaga7i, Wonggele Abrahamas tiinidhii ohida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:3">Medho 12:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9"/>Yinnii gisho, ammanze ubba ammanide Abrahamera wolla anjjinttoda.<verse eid="GAL 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10"/>Higge naagii xilloda gaaze ooden baaditsi gidda yene. Akkos gayko, Geeshi Maxaafite, «Higge maxaafite xaafinttidanne ubba miinggi yezoossen oochchoosse ooden baadinttidaya maaqqo» ga7intti xaafinttida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 27:26">Mahe 27:26</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11"/>«Xillo ammanora yessada» ga7intti xaafinttide gisho ooden Xoozze tiino higge naagii xilloosanna erinttidebaz.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 2:4">Ibr. 2:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12"/>Higge ammanoppa baaya. Yezin, «Higgito naagize ooden izo kaalloda» yaga7inttida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:5">Leewe 18:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="GAL 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13"/>«Minxalla afa suxuntti hyayqqide ooden baaddinttidaya» ga7intti xaafinttida. Kiristtoosa nu gisho baaddinttezaya maaqqii, nuna higge baadditsappa wozida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 21:23">Mahe 21:23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14"/>Xoozii Abrahamas inggide anjjita, Yesuus Kiristtoosa baggara Ayhude maaqqoosse asuntsana yellode fanan Xoozii inggoda gayde Geeshi Ayyaana ufayssi ammanora ekkode fana yinno oochchida.<verse eid="GAL 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Higgen ufays qaala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15"/>Ta ishuntso, ta yinttis as de7o duse maaqqii yeze baz aazize mahi ohine. Asi caaqqide caaqita miinggidannippa suuba, ooden yinna caaqito shaarodes woy melle gujjodes dandda7oos. <verse eid="GAL 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16"/>Xoozii yinna ufays qaaltto Abrahamasin E zaruntsis inggida. Geeshi Maxaafite, gaama asis ohize fana, «Ne kochchuntsis» ga7oos. Yezin fettii asis ohize fana, «Ne kochchitis» yagayda; ezin Kiristtoosa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:7">Medho 12:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="GAL 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17"/>Taanii gaazanna hyanno; oyddii xeeti hyasttam bereppa suuba ingginttide higgita, tiino Xoozii mintside caaqito shaarii ufays qaaltto dhabisodes dandda7oos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:40">Keze 12:40</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18"/>Xoozii inggize laatita higgera ekkinttizebaz maaqqizako Xoozii inggide ufays qaala baggara maaqqizanna attane. Yezin Xoozii fa aadho keehatitsite laata Abrahamas ufays qaala baggara inggida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:14">Rome 4:14</ref></char></note><verse eid="GAL 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19"/>Yeezin, higge akkos ingginttido? Higge ingginttidanna, Abrahamas ufays qaala ingginttide kochchita ye7ode wontsis iita oocha akko yezako beessades. Higge kiitanchcho baggara ingginttii, gidda maaqqii giigize fettii as baggara oochalla afa feezhida. <verse eid="GAL 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20"/>Gidda maaqqii giigize atstse lam77i zalas oochchane fattin fetes baaya, yezin Xoozii fetto.<verse eid="GAL 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21"/>Yeezin, higge Xoozze ufays qaala ixxanene? Ade! Higge inginttidanna asis de7o inggodes maaqqizako, turii xillotitsi higge baggara maaqqadyeshsha. <verse eid="GAL 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22"/>Yezin Yesuus Kiristtoosa ammanin benttize ufays qaaltto ammanzutsis ingginttode fana kumutsi alamtta nagaras oomora yezanno Geeshi Maxaafite ohine.<verse eid="GAL 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23"/>Yezin ammano ye7odannippa tiino higgera acinttii yene yeshsha. Yinna ammantta qonccode wontsis higgera naaginttii yezida. <verse eid="GAL 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24"/>Yinnii gisho, nuunii ammanora xillode fana Kiristtoosa ye7ode wontsis higge melle as na7a naagize asi fana nuna naagizaya maaqqida. <verse eid="GAL 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25"/>Yezin hyatte ammano yi7ide gisho higge yikkeppa suuba melle as na7a naagize asi fana nuna naagizanna attida.<verse eid="GAL 3:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26"/>Yin ubbuntsi Yesuus Kiristtoosa ammanii Xoozis na7untsana maaqqida. <verse eid="GAL 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27"/>Kiristtoosara fetto maaqqades xammaqinttide ubbuntsi Kiristtoosa ma77ida. <verse eid="GAL 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28"/>Yin ubbuntsi Kiristtoosa gidda fetto maaqqize gisho Ayhude asunts giddan Girike asunts gidda, aro giddan bonchcho as gidda, dhiiratsi giddan maachi gidda dummatitsi baaya. <verse eid="GAL 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29"/>Yikke, yin Kiristtoosas maaqqiko yin Abrahama kochchi. Xoozze ufays qaaltti fana yin laattizuntsana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:13">Rome 4:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="GAL 3:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1"/>Ta gaazanna hyanno. Laattizay na7a maaqqii yeze wode, ubba bazis Laatstsii maaqqikon, aroppa akkon dummudhoos. <verse eid="GAL 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2"/>Yezin E aday gayde wode yellodes wontsis E hyadarto ekkiduntsi kushen naagizunts kushe yene. <verse eid="GAL 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3"/>Yinnii gaara, nuunii na7atitsa yeze wode alame tiino wogas aqii aridhdhii yene. <verse eid="GAL 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4"/>Yezin wodita yellide wode Xooz higgeppa oomora, maachippa yelinttide fa na7aya kiittida. <verse eid="GAL 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5"/>E yinno oochchidanna, higges aqii yezuntsana wozodesin nuna fa na7a mahodes.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5-7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:15-17">Rome 8:15-17</ref></char></note><verse eid="GAL 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6"/>Nu Xoozze na7a maaqqize gisho «Abbo, Abbaba» ga7i xeegize fa Na7ay Ayyaana nu wozintti gidda kiittida. <verse eid="GAL 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7"/>Yinnii gisho, yikkeppa neenii Xoozze na7a fattin aro baaya. Neenii E na7a maaqqiko, Kiristtoosa baggara Xooz laattiza maaqqane.<verse eid="GAL 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Galaatiya asuntsis qoppida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8"/>Yin zaga Xoozza eroosse wode fa hyanotitsite xooz maaqqoosuntsis aro maaqqii aqida. <verse eid="GAL 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9"/>Yezin hyatte yin Xoozza erida; aatsii Xoozara erinttida. Yeezin mahi fatstsoossen maaddoosse alame wogago suuba wayzi maaqqidate? Wodhdhii eqqii, wayzi unttis mahi aro maaqqades koyete? <verse eid="GAL 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10"/>Dummudhide qammas, aginas, wodesin beres yin dummuzi loytsii bonchcho inggane. <verse eid="GAL 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11"/>Ood erize hyarii ta yinttis labbid yessane ga7i zhashitane.<verse eid="GAL 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12"/>Ta ishuntso, ta yin fana maaqqide gisho yinttin ta fana maaqqote ga7i yinttana woossane. Yin tana fettii bazaran qohikaaya. <verse eid="GAL 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13"/>Taanii tiino hyargginttitera yinttis Wonggele ohidanno yin erane. <verse eid="GAL 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14"/>Ta hyarggita yinttis faatana maaqqikon, tana borikaaya; antsinttikaaya. Yezin tana Xoozze kiitanchcho woy Kiristtoos Yesuusa mokkizannifana mokkida.<verse eid="GAL 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15"/>Yikke, yin tana ufaysidanna ane? Yinttis dandda7inttizako, yin taas, yin aafto kessii inggizako ixxosanno ta markkidhane. <verse eid="GAL 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16"/>Yeezin, ta yinttis turito ohide gisho yinttis morkke maaqqid yessane?<verse eid="GAL 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17"/>Yentsi asuntsi yinttana mintsii koyane, yezin lo77oos baaya. Mintsii koyzanna yinttana shaakkodesin faas qoppode fana yissades amudhdhane. <verse eid="GAL 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18"/>Lo77o baz oochchodes beeziduntsana maaqqiko lo77o, yezin yinna ta yinttara yeze wode xalaala maaqqikaayzin ubba wode maaqqe.<verse eid="GAL 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19"/>Ta siiqo na7untso, Kiristtoosa yinggida si7ile fana yi7ade wontsis yelos maacha dha7inttizanni gaara ta yin gisho dha7inttane. <verse eid="GAL 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20"/>Yin baz taas workkita maaqqin un77inttane; hyatte yin gidda ta benttii zhilidhdhi ohizako akko gaar kadhane yeshsha.<verse eid="GAL 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Aggaaron Saaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21"/>Higge aqii yessades koyzuntso, ane taas ohote; higge akko gaazako si7osite? <verse eid="GAL 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22"/>Geeshi Maxaafite, «Abrahamas arttippan kara inttippa yelinttide lam77i na7untsi yene» yagaane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 16:15">Medho 16:15</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 21:2">21:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23"/>Arttii na7ay as na7a yelinttize wogara yelinttida, yezin kara inttii na7ay Xoozze ufays qaalara yelinttida.<verse eid="GAL 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24"/>Hyants maachuntsi lam77i caaquntsis aazize maaqqii ekkinttane. Unttappa fetta, Siina Derizeppa yi7idanna, fa na7untsana arotitsis yelida; izan Aggaaro. <verse eid="GAL 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25"/>Aggaara Arabe sa7a yeze Siina Dereppa. Hyatte yeze Yerusalaame aazane. Iza fa na7untsara arotitsa yene. <verse eid="GAL 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26"/>Yezin salo Yerusalaame wallotitsa yezanno; izan nu ubbuntsis inddo. <verse eid="GAL 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27"/>Geeshi Maxaafite,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">«Na7ite, yeloosse dhoontsite ufaytto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">na7ite yelo dha7i eroosanne ililio.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">Azinara yeze maachitippa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">azini baayze maachitis na7untsi gaama» yagaane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:1">Isa. 54:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="GAL 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28"/>Ta ishuntso, nuunii Yisaaqa fana Xoozze ufays qaalara yelinttide na7a. <verse eid="GAL 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29"/>Yezin ye wode as wogara yelinttide, Ayyaana wolqqara yelinttidaya baytsida. Hyaynon yinnii fana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:9">Medho 21:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30"/>Yezin Geeshi Maxaafta waage? «Arttii na7ay kara inttii na7ayra fettilla laattoose gisho artton I na7ayra kessii dakko» yagaane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:10">Medho 21:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31"/>Yinnii gisho, ta ishuntso, nuunii kara inttii na7untsana fattin arttii na7untsana baaya.<verse eid="GAL 4:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Kiristtoosa gidda yeze wallotitsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1"/>Nuunii wallotitsa yessade fana Kiristtoosa nuna arotitsappa kessida. Yikke, miinggi eqqote; mahi arotitsi qambbara waaxinttippete.<verse eid="GAL 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2"/>Taanii, Phawuloosa, gaazanno si7ote. Yin garrazinttiko, Kiristtoosa yinttana akkon maaddoos. <verse eid="GAL 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3"/>Garrazinttize ooden higge kiittize ubba folodes beezizanno fetes fetes mahi ohine. <verse eid="GAL 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4"/>Higge naagii xillodes koyzuntso, Kiristtoosappa shaakkintti; Xoozze aadho keehatitsappa gol7ida. <verse eid="GAL 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5"/>Yezin nuunii Xoozze Ayyaana baggara ammanora xillodanno ufayssara naagane. <verse eid="GAL 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6"/>Yikke, Kiristtoos Yesuusa gidda yeziko, siiqo oocha qonccize ammano fattin garrazinttin, garrazinttanxin nuna akkon maaddoos.<verse eid="GAL 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7"/>Lo77o woxxane yeshsha, yezin hyatte turis kiitinttaame fana yinttana kayde oode? <verse eid="GAL 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8"/>Hyannii fana iita zore yinttana xeegide Xoozzeppa baaya. <verse eid="GAL 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9"/>Yinnan, «Eerats irshsho buka ubba dentsitsane»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 5:6">1 Qoro. 5:6</ref></char></note>ga7inttide fana. <verse eid="GAL 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10"/>Yinttis melle qofa baayzanno folo Laatstsella ammaninttane. Yezin yinttana buqize ooden Xoozappa fa firddito ekkoda.<verse eid="GAL 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11"/>Ta ishuntso, ta hyayno yellodes garrazintte sabbakize baz maaqqiko, yeezin tana akkos bay7e? Yinno subbakizebaz maaqqiko Kiristtoosa masqalabaz asuntsis dhube maaqqizanna attane yeshsha. <verse eid="GAL 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12"/>Yinttana buqizuntsi garrazintte xalaala maaqqikaayzin fa agastto gachchizakon ta kadhane.<verse eid="GAL 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13"/>Ta ishuntso, yin wallo yessades xeeginttida. Maaqqoyezin, yin wallotitsita asho amotitsi folodes yinttis oge maaqqippe; yinnippa aatsii fetay fetays siiqora aro fana maaqqote. <verse eid="GAL 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14"/>Higge ubba, fettii qaalara acinttida. Yinnan «Ne laggiza ne ommiti fana kadho» gaazanno.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Leewe 19:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15"/>Yezin yin fetay fetayra saxinttizebazin mu7inttizebaz maaqqiko, yin woli hyaasaame fana naaginttote.<verse eid="GAL 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayyaan de7on asho de7o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16"/>Yikke, ta yinttis ohine; Ayyaanara yezote; yin asho amuto mulon folippete. <verse eid="GAL 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17"/>Asho Ayyaanalla Ayyaana asholla amudhdhane; unttin fete fetera ixinttane. Yinnii gisho yin kadhizebaz oochchodes dandda7oos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 7:15-23">Rome 7:15-23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18"/>Ayyaanara kaallizebaz maaqqiko higge yinttana ahoos.<verse eid="GAL 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19"/>Asho oochuntsi erinttiduntsana; unttin, olale, tunatitsi, qayxe, <verse eid="GAL 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20"/>eeqas goyne, bita, morkketitsi, kachchi, qanaate, zhilo, zadzdza7intte, fana kadhe, shaakkintte, iita zore <verse eid="GAL 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21"/>gene, matstse, yetstsin yinno aazizuntsana; tiino ta yinttis ohidanni fana hyatten ta yinttis ohine. Hyannii fana aazizebazito oochchizuntsi Xoozze ka7itumo geloos.<verse eid="GAL 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22"/>Yezin Ayyaana aafe, siiqo, ufayssi, sarotitsi, dandda7a, keehatitsi, lo77otitsi, ammano, <verse eid="GAL 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23"/>aadatitsi, fana ahe. Hyannii fana aazizebazito ixxize higge baaya.<verse eid="GAL 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24"/>Kiristtoos Yesuusa baz maaqqiduntsi fa ashito Iis yeze iita qoftiran I amotitsitira wolla masqalalla afa suxxida. <verse eid="GAL 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25"/>Ayyaanara yeze baz maaqqiko, nuunii Ayyaanar kaalloda. <verse eid="GAL 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26"/>Ane fete fetella zhilidhdhittera, dendditteran qanaatitteran hyappo ceeqinttizanno ashshoda.<verse eid="GAL 5:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Fetay feta maaddote</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1"/>Ta ishuntso, asi akko qohe gidda gol7iko, Ayyaanara yeze yin ye atstsa ashkketitsara luulizote. Yezin neenii yinnii gaarze bazara fattanintaame gaar nena naago. <verse eid="GAL 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2"/>Yinttappa Fetay fete tooftto tookko. Yeyzitera Kiristtoosa higge folote. <verse eid="GAL 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3"/>Fete asi akkon hyanikaayzin, akkon hyanide fana melluntsappa lo77o ga7i qoppiko, E fana cimmane. <verse eid="GAL 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4"/>Yezin fete fete fa omma oochito fattano. Yinnippa suuba, melluntsis hyanikaayze baz fa xalaalas ceeqinttize baz demmada. <verse eid="GAL 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5"/>Fete fete fa tooftto tookkodes beezane.<verse eid="GAL 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6"/>Yezin Xoozze qaala tamaarize tamaarssizera lo77o baz ubba gishinttane.<verse eid="GAL 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7"/>Balinttippete, Xoozii ciminttoos Asi fa budizanno mahi maxoda. <verse eid="GAL 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8"/>Fa asho amora budize ooden, fa asho amotitsitippa wooqa maxoda. Yezin Ayyaanara budize ooden Ayyaanappa medhina de7o maxoda. <verse eid="GAL 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9"/>Azal7anxiko nu woder maxoda. Lo77o oocha oochchodes azal7oos. <verse eid="GAL 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10"/>Yikke wottize wode denggiko, asi ubbas, aatsii ammanze asis lo77o baz oochchoda.<verse eid="GAL 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wurssutsi zoren saritsen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11"/>Taanii ta kushera, akko gaar damma fidaalera yinttis xaafezako bo7ote. <verse eid="GAL 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12"/>As tiino lo77o maaqqii benttodes koyze asuntsi yin garrazinttode fana koyane. Yezin yinno un oochchizanna, Kiristtoosa masqala gisho unttana baytsi yellaame fana. <verse eid="GAL 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13"/>Un yin garrazinttidanne ceeqinttodes koyi «Yinttana garrazinttote!» gaane fattin garrazinttiduntsin fa ommite higge naagoos.<verse eid="GAL 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14"/>Yezin alame taas suxinttidayppan taanin alames suxunttide, Laatstse Yesuus Kiristtoosa masqalappa melle ceeqintte taappa hyaakko. <verse eid="GAL 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15"/>Yikke, garrazinttin garrazinttanxin akkon maaddoos. Kiristtoos Yesuusara kille medho maaqqe maaddane. <verse eid="GAL 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16"/>Hyanna wogito kaallize ubbuntsisin Xoozze worzha maaqqide Isra7eeluntsis sarotitsin maarotitsin maaqqe.<verse eid="GAL 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17"/>Taanii Yesuusa hyarggide beetto ta ashite tookkida, yikkeppa tana akkon labbizoos.<verse eid="GAL 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18"/>Ta ishuntso, nu Laatstse Yesuus Kiristtoosa aadho keehatitsi Ayyaana yinttara maaqqe. Amin77e.<verse eid="GAL 6:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6"/>
</usx>
